RISK DISCLOSURE AND DISCLAIMER

This software places, replaces and cancels REAL ORDERS on a REAL TopstepX
account. It is provided for educational and research purposes only. Nothing in
this repository is financial, investment or trading advice, or a recommendation
to buy or sell any financial instrument.

Trading futures and other leveraged products carries a substantial risk of
loss, and you can lose more than your initial deposit. This software is a
one-way mirror with no reconciliation: an order can be missed, duplicated,
filled on one account and not the other, or left resting after the source
account is flat. A defect in this software, in your configuration, network,
Sierra Chart installation or the TopstepX API can lose money. Test it on a
practice account before putting money behind it, and watch the TopstepX portal
the whole time it runs.

You are solely responsible for every order this software sends; for verifying
that mirroring or copying trades is permitted under the terms of TopstepX and
of any proprietary trading firm, broker or evaluation program whose account you
connect; and for complying with all laws and regulations that apply to you. The
authors and copyright holder accept no liability for any loss, account breach
or rule violation arising from its use.
